# Four Moxen pay for Daretti, Scrap Savant on turn 1. His +2 discards up to two cards and draws that many: Bot1 discards
# Mox Emerald and an Island (loyalty 5). On turn 3 his -2 has Bot1 sacrifice an artifact of their choice (Mox Pearl, of
# four) and, since they did, return the Mox Emerald from the graveyard to the battlefield (loyalty 3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Daretti, Scrap Savant
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Daretti, Scrap Savant.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Daretti, Scrap Savant.Activate(Ability: Discard up to two)
Bot1.Choose(Mox Emerald; Island)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Mox Emerald
? Bot1.Battlefield.Daretti, Scrap Savant.Counters.Loyalty = 5
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Daretti, Scrap Savant.Activate(Ability: Sacrifice an artifact; Bot1.Graveyard.Mox Emerald)
Bot1.Choose(Mox Pearl)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Daretti, Scrap Savant.Counters.Loyalty = 3

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Mox Pearl; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Daretti, Scrap Savant.Counters.Loyalty = 3
